[[264,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Drain the air conditioner coolant circuit\n\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238307\">5040A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the air conditioning compressor\nsupport (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018444.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Place the air conditioning compressor mounting (1a) back in its\nhousing and fix it tightening the bolts (1b) to the recommended\ntorque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>COMPRESSOR MOUNT (AC)</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Crankcase side) 4.5 ÷ 5.5</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018445.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[264,127,16,"<p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238307\">5040A20</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238221\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Fill the air conditioner coolant circuit\n\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal.</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[64,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237699\">1072C44</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection from the air conditioning\ncompressor.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Air conditioning compressor &quot;on&quot; electromagnet</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236734\">L20</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the upper bolts fixing the air conditioning compressor.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018446.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[64,127,16,"<p>Raise the car.</p><p>1. Undo the lower bolts (1a) and move the air conditioning compressor\n(1b) fastening it appropriately.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018447.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[64,127,16,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the air conditioning compressor\nsupport (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018448.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[64,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the air conditioning compressor mounting\nand secure it using the bolts.</p><p>Place the air conditioning compressor back\nin its housing and secure it using the lower bolts.</p><p>Lower the vehicle.</p><p>Tighten the upper air conditioning compressor\nbolts.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nair conditioning compressor.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237699\">1072C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238224\">4450B10</a></p>"],[512,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Refer to op. \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238307\">5040A20</a>\n                                           , without\ndisconnecting the pipes from the air conditioning compressor.</p><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a) and remove the air conditioning compressor\nsupport (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018449.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[512,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the air conditioning compressor mounting\nand secure it tightening the bolts to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>Air conditioning compressor support</p></td><td><p>M10</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.2 - 5.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3238307\">5040A20</a></p>"],[1024,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the vehicle on a lift.</p><p>Drain the coolant (\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a>\n                                           ).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238964\">7055B42</a>\n                                           (right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a>\n                                           (right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238307\">5040A20</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts securing the mounting.</p><p>2. Remove the support complete with fixed tensioner.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2070037.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,16,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the compressor mounting is not\ndamaged.</p><p>Reposition the compressor mounting.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238307\">5040A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237644\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238967\">7055B64</a>\n                                           (right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238964\">7055B42</a>\n                                           (right)</p><p>Repressurize using coolant fluid (\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238305\">5040A10</a>\n                                           ).</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the lift.</p>"]]